# Terraform local-value + state artifacts for the DNS config (AAASM-5517).
# The Workspace mail runbook (README.md) instructs the owner to keep
# tenant-issued values in a *.tfvars at apply time; these MUST never be
# committed, nor may resolved state. Root .gitignore does not cover these.
*.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
